<Base title="Depth-First Search · ITC 120" description="Depth-first search (DFS): going deep with a stack written as one row, backtracking, directed and disconnected graphs, and how it compares with BFS." course={{ code: course.code, href: base + course.href }} theme="tocall subgap" toc>
